WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.297
Welcome to our overview of B2B Central.

00:00:03.297 --> 00:00:06.960
If you're a new professional seller in the Amazon store

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:12.640
or new to selling to Amazon business customers, you might be looking for a better way to understand

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.992
and manage your business to business or B2B sales.

00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:19.040
B2B Central can help you get started with

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.526
recommended actions and resources.

00:00:20.526 --> 00:00:24.240
It can also help grow your business by providing insights

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.232
into your B2B sales.

00:00:26.232 --> 00:00:30.880
You can find B2B Central by opening the Seller Central main menu,

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:35.170
hovering over B2B and clicking B2B Central.

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:37.120
You'll see a static menu,

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.280
widgets to help you get started, and a set of dashboards and reports.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.684
Let's start by exploring the dashboards.

00:00:43.684 --> 00:00:47.680
You can use each dashboard in B2B Central to view data

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:51.464
and generate graphs and tables for your B2B sales.

00:00:51.464 --> 00:00:54.560
Click the dropdown menus in each dashboard to gain

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.747
insights into trends and turning points.

00:00:56.747 --> 00:01:01.120
The sales snapshot lets you view and compare your B2B

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.109
and non-B2B sales.

00:01:03.109 --> 00:01:08.080
Pull your data by number of sales or units sold and specify a date range.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:13.600
Then review your results using the line graph at the top and table at the bottom of the dashboard.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:18.560
You can also compare sales in your selected date range to your performance during the same time

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.280
last year.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:23.240
Or you can review changes in your sales year over year.

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.040
We provide total sales for

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:31.840
both B2B and non-B2B transactions along with the number of customer orders, order items, and units

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:32.156
sold.

00:01:32.156 --> 00:01:38.160
We use this information to provide a profile for an average order so you can see what a typical

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.072
business customer has been purchasing from you.

00:01:41.072 --> 00:01:44.400
B2B performance by customer segment provides

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.900
insights into the types of business customers buying from you.

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.000
You can filter your sales using

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.899
three customer types, industry, region, or size.

00:01:52.899 --> 00:01:57.040
Pick a customer type, choose to view your data by

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:00.612
number of sales or units sold, and specify a date range.

00:02:00.612 --> 00:02:02.560
Then review your results using the

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:06.489
pie chart at the top and table at the bottom of the dashboard.

00:02:06.489 --> 00:02:08.000
For example, see the difference

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.901
between your sales to commercial and education customers.

00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:13.440
For each sub-segment, we provide your

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:17.596
sales year over year, your total sales, and an average order.

00:02:17.596 --> 00:02:20.240
Top B2B products by customer

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.891
segment lists your best-selling products in descending order.

00:02:23.891 --> 00:02:25.920
Pick the industry or industries

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:32.004
you want to track, view by number of sales or units sold, and specify your date range.

00:02:32.004 --> 00:02:32.720
We provide

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:36.066
each product and your total sales and units sold.

00:02:36.066 --> 00:02:39.040
You can also manage pricing, inventory, or images

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:45.760
for a product using the edit drop-down menu, or click advertise listings to create an Amazon ads

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:46.173
campaign.

00:02:46.173 --> 00:02:52.362
Next to your B2B central dashboards, we provide access to a downloadable report.

00:02:52.362 --> 00:02:53.600
B2B

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:59.200
quantity discount impact lets you see the effect your discounts have had on your sales and product

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.259
detail page views.

00:03:00.259 --> 00:03:05.200
Compare the number of units sold, orders received for a given product, and the

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.773
percentage of times your products appeared as the featured offer.

00:03:08.773 --> 00:03:10.560
In addition to your dashboards

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:17.600
and the B2B quantity discount impact report, B2B central houses a suite of resources and tools

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.383
for Amazon business sellers.

00:03:19.383 --> 00:03:23.394
The static menu takes you to frequently visited pages.

00:03:23.394 --> 00:03:23.840
Click

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:29.600
manage quotes to view and respond to requests from business customers who want to buy specific

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.859
products in bulk at a discount.

00:03:31.859 --> 00:03:36.000
In some cases you may also see requests from business customers

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.140
for custom quotes.

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:43.600
Visit the B2B product opportunities page to explore weekly suggestions for B2B products.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:50.000
We include products in high demand from categories you already sell in as well as products requested

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.078
by business customers that may not yet be available in the Amazon store.

00:03:55.078 --> 00:03:56.640
Click business profile to

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:02.400
add a mission statement, logo, featured image, or other information to your public seller profile.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:06.432
This can help showcase your company to business customers.

00:04:06.432 --> 00:04:08.640
Looking for specific steps to get

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.623
started as a B2B seller?

00:04:10.623 --> 00:04:15.440
Click grow B2B sales to get a list of actions you can take to encourage

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.114
sales from business customers.

00:04:17.114 --> 00:04:20.880
Click business discount insights if you'd like help setting

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.816
business prices and quantity discounts for your products.

00:04:23.816 --> 00:04:27.120
We provide a ranked list of 10 of your

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:32.480
products that could benefit from business pricing and offer both suggested prices and possible

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:33.227
quantity tiers.

00:04:33.227 --> 00:04:38.080
You can also download a full list of products we're recommending business discounts

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:38.504
for.

00:04:38.504 --> 00:04:45.280
If you have a brand enrolled in Amazon brand registry, click case pack recommendations to get

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:51.495
a list of single unit products you may be able to sell to business customers as case packs.

00:04:51.495 --> 00:04:51.840
Review

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:57.200
a ranked list of suggested products that have been purchased in multi-unit orders along with our

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:58.693
recommended case pack sizes.

00:04:58.693 --> 00:05:03.920
You'll also find widgets in the scrolling menu in B2B central that

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:08.144
suggest actions to help you get started with B2B sales.

00:05:08.144 --> 00:05:10.960
Click icons to get tips, set prices and

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.360
discounts or automate business pricing.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:18.160
You can explore B2B product recommendations, respond to

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:22.075
customer quote requests and update your business profile too.

00:05:22.075 --> 00:05:25.120
We put all these resources in one

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.365
place to simplify and coordinate your business sales in Seller Central.

00:05:29.365 --> 00:05:31.680
This concludes our B2B

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.265
central overview.

00:05:33.265 --> 00:05:40.400
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store.
